    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Back In Stock Notify</strong> allows customers to subscribe to stock notifications for out-of-stock products.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Allow customers to register for stock notifications.</li>\n<li>Manage email subscriptions for each product in the WordPress admin panel.</li>\n<li>Works seamlessly with WooCommerce.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv3 or later. See the <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">License URI</a> for more information.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>The plugin can be installed from a ZIP file via the WordPress Dashboard.</li>\n<li>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Click “Upload Plugin” at the top</li>\n<li>Upload the back-in-stock-notify.zip file</li>\n<li>Make sure WooCommerce is installed and active.</li>\n<li>Once installed, click “Activate Plugin”</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Notify customers when out-of-stock products are back in stock. Collect email addresses and manage them in the admin panel.",
